  "label": "Western Standard of Beauty and Emotional Expression",
  "description": "The meme implicitly references the Western cultural standard that equates happiness with a specific facial expression (a wide, toothy smile) and that emotional authenticity must be 'performed' for the camera. This standard is often imposed on non-Western subjects, who are expected to conform to it, even if their expressions are genuine or culturally different.",
